        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>腊八粥 课文批注页</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #fdf6ea;\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 10px 18px 20px 18px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  p { margin: 0 0 4px 0; text-indent: 0; }\n  .num { font-weight: bold; }\n  .u { text-decoration: underline; }\n  .wavy { text-decoration: underline wavy; }\n  .pink { background: #f7b6cf; }\n  .purple { background: #c9a8e0; }\n  .ann {\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    border: 1px solid #c0392b;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 0 4px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .ann-plain {\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .pinyin {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #333;\n    display: inline-block;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1;\n    vertical-align: text-top;\n  }\n  .top-line {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .wrap-section {\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    background: #efe6d5;\n    color: #555;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .photo {\n    width: 260px;\n    height: 250px;\n    float: left;\n    margin: 4px 12px 6px 0;\n  }\n  .right-col {\n    margin-left: 275px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <p class=\"top-line\"><span class=\"u\">八儿molt里的饿</span><span class=\"ann-plain\">[illegible]</span>，可以说是不可靠的，唯一[?]的[?]<span class=\"ann-plain\">[illegible]</span></p>\n\n  <p>饿，<span class=\"u\">也不可靠</span>，不过因为一进灶房，就听到那锅中叹气又像是正在<br>\n  <span class=\"pinyin\">nāng</span>嘟囔的声音，因好奇而急于想尝尝这奇怪的东西<span class=\"u\">罢了</span>。</p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"num\">9.</span>“妈，妈，等一下我要吃三碗！我们只准大哥吃一碗。大哥同<br>\n  爹都吃不得甜的，我们俩光吃甜的也行……妈，你吃三碗我也<br>\n  吃三碗，大哥同爹只准各吃一碗，——共八碗，是吗？”<span class=\"ann\">语言描写</span></p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"ann-plain\">→</span><span class=\"u\">妈妈也很懂得孩子的一种[?]呀</span><span class=\"ann-plain\">。</span></p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"num\">10.</span>“是呀！<span class=\"u\">坚坚说得好</span>。”</p>\n\n  <p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"ann-plain\">跟妈妈讨价还价</span>“想多分些<span class=\"ann-plain\">[illegible]</span></p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"num\">11.</span>“<span class=\"u\">要不然我吃三碗半</span>，你就吃两碗半……”<span class=\"ann-plain\">→</span>粥，体现出八儿天真、聪明、饿。</p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"ann\">语言描写</span> <span class=\"ann-plain\">拟人</span></p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"num\">12.</span>“<span class=\"pinyin\">pū</span>噗……”锅内又叹了声气。八儿回过头来，<span class=\"u\">也不过是看到一</span></p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"u\">股淡淡烟气往上一冲而已！</span> <span class=\"ann-plain\">→反问八儿猜想腊八粥、吃腊八粥的做了铺垫</span></p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"num\">13.</span>锅中的一切，对八儿来说，只能<span class=\"u\">猜想</span>：栗子已稀烂到认不清楚<br>\n  了吧，饭豆会煮得浑身肿胀了吧，花生仁吃来总该是面面的了！枣<br>\n  子大了三四倍——要是真的干红枣也有那么大，那就妙极了！糖<br>\n  若放多了，它会起锅巴……<span class=\"ann\">心理描写</span></p>\n\n  <p style=\"margin-left:130px;\">“妈，妈，<span class=\"u\">你抱我起来看看吧！</span>”于是</p>\n\n  <p>妈妈就如八儿所求的把他抱了起来<span class=\"ann-plain\">//</span><span class=\"ann\">语言描写</span></p>\n\n  <p style=\"text-align:right;\"><span class=\"ann-plain\">→八儿想验证自己想法是否正确，也<br>\n  从妈妈抱起他表现了他的好奇。</span></p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"num\">14.</span>“呃……”他<span class=\"u\">惊异</span>得喊起来了，锅内的一切都进了他的眼中。</p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"num\">15.</span>这不能不说是奇怪呀，栗子跌进锅里，不久就得粉碎，那是他</p>\n\n  <div class=\"wrap-section\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Illustration: 母亲抱着孩子在灶房，左下方有陶罐与灶台 — 页面左下]</div>\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n      <p>知道的。他曾过跌进黄焖<br>\n      鸡锅子里的一群栗子，不<br>\n      久就融掉了。饭豆煮得肿<br>\n      胀，那也是往常<span class=\"pink\">熬粥</span><span class=\"pinyin\">mēn</span>时常见<br>\n      的事。花生仁脱了它的红外<br>\n      套，这是不消说的事。锅<br>\n      巴，正是围了锅边成一圈。</p>\n      <p><span class=\"purple\">总之</span>，一切都成了如他所猜</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p><span class=\"ann-plain\">照应前文</span><span class=\"ann-plain\">→只是</span><span class=\"pink\">粥</span>想的样子，虽然浪漫料<br>\n  之处，只是<span class=\"pink\">粥</span>的颜色却仍他的<br>\n  <span class=\"ann-plain\">[illegible]</span></p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
